hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1652","###\n Ahmad ibn Abdah narrated to us, informing us that Hammad ibn Zayd narrated, from Hisham ibn Urwah, from his father, that Abdullah ibn al-Arqam used to travel, and a group of people would accompany him, following his lead. He said: He would call the Adhan for his companions and lead them in prayer. He said: One day, the Iqamah for prayer was announced, then he said: \One of you should lead you in prayer"","" for I heard the Messenger of Allah"""""
